# Optional: anonymous feedback + one-click parse-failure reports collected into
# a Google Sheet via a Google Apps Script web app (free, no login for users).
# Setup: see google-apps-script/Code.gs, then paste the deployed web-app URL here.
# Without it, feedback stays local and the report button falls back to copy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_APPS_SCRIPT_URL=

# Alternative collector: Supabase (supabase/schema.sql). Only one is needed —
# set these instead of the Apps Script URL if you prefer Supabase.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
